<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait private deposits up in October.</title>
<headline>Kuwait private deposits up in October.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Private sector deposits with banks in Kuwait rose to 6.874 billion dinars at the end of October from 6.765 billion at the end of September, Central Bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The deposits stood at 7.107 billion in October 1995.</p>
<p>			   Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				  Oct '96    Sept '96   Oct '95</p>
<p>Dinar deposits		5,620.2    5,507.8    5,756.1</p>
<p>Foreign currency deposits 1,253.3    1,257.1    1,350.5</p>
<p>($1 = 0.302 dinar)</p>
</text>
